266 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 26 0 R/E(LIVING SOIL. Scoop up a handful of garden soil and look close: it is not dirt, it is alive. One handful holds more tiny creatures than there are people on earth, all quietly working for free. God designed the soil to feed your plants, so a wise gardener feeds the soil and lets it do the work; we do not build fertility in a factory, we protect the life already there.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

